 0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-126351/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b55b50a0-034f-57c0-8a61-883cfb0412dc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-126351"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42116/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "b0295ed6-c38f-551a-a0c5-83dc246ea592" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42116/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "f6a1aaec-41fe-5805-9aca-2d7bb008d178" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42116/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "a9fb7c3e-f8c3-5c25-94fc-74af0e5c0b27" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42116/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "d0effccf-e3cb-51f9-965d-e942f84fe48c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42116/selection/93198c2e65472148f49c73a47d70892e6efd0b46acbb489ee2afeea42a4a8c25" :answer/id #uuid "2b61ea15-7ad6-5d32-a0ed-65d03e42969f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42116/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "588d5705-43ea-5d79-be22-88fac1741406" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-42116/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer-field/choices ["q-42116/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-42116/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" "q-42116/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-42116/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-42116/selection/93198c2e65472148f49c73a47d70892e6efd0b46acbb489ee2afeea42a4a8c25"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-42116" :question/id #uuid "4ace65b7-bf81-524d-8427-a694b672af28" :question/math-academy-id "q-42116" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $A$ is lower triangular\n- ${A}^{T}-A$ is lower triangular\n- $A$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since the result of ${A}^{T}-A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}-A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-42116/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42116"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74319/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "b47d86d8-b996-5f93-9d7d-f3de3fc8dc6e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74319/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "d937b010-0a72-5665-8c64-64a033d381d1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensur